  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5314,
      "text": "Their eyes will be downcast, overwhelmed with humiliation, for they were invited to prostrate when they were capable[10] [but they refused].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5315,
      "text": "So leave to Me those who reject this message [O Prophet]. We will gradually lead them to their ruin in ways that they do not perceive[11].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5316,
      "text": "I will give them respite, but My plan is firm.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5317,
      "text": "Or are you asking them for a reward, so they find it too burdensome?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5318,
      "text": "Or do they have knowledge of the unseen, so they write it down?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5319,
      "text": "So be patient with the decree of your Lord, and do not be like the man of the Whale [i.e., Jonah], when he cried out in anguish[12].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5320,
      "text": "Had it not been for the grace that he received from his Lord, he would have surely been thrown onto the barren shore, blameworthy[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5321,
      "text": "But his Lord chose him and made him one of the righteous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5322,
      "text": "The disbelievers would almost strike you down with their malicious gazes when they hear the Reminder, and they say, “He is certainly mad.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5323,
      "text": "But it is nothing other than a reminder to the whole world.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5324,
      "text": "The Inevitable Hour!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5325,
      "text": "What is the Inevitable Hour?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5326,
      "text": "How do you know what the Inevitable Hour is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5327,
      "text": "Thamūd and ‘Ād denied the Striking Calamity of the Hour[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5328,
      "text": "As for Thamūd, they were destroyed by a dreadful blast.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5329,
      "text": "And as for ‘Ād, they were destroyed by a furious windstorm[2]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5330,
      "text": "which He unleashed against them for seven successive nights and eight days, so you would see the people lying dead as if they were hollow trunks of palm trees.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5331,
      "text": "Do you see any trace of them now?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
